(NORTHWIND BANK LIMITED) Tj T*
(INTERNAL KYC AND CUSTOMER DATA POLICY \(FICTIONAL SAMPLE, VERSION 3.2\)) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(1. Purpose and scope. This policy sets the minimum Know Your Customer \(KYC\) and customer data) Tj T*
(requirements for Northwind Bank and for every vendor that processes customer data on its) Tj T*
(behalf. Vendor contracts must not permit practices weaker than this policy.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(2. Customer identification and proof of address. Address must be verified using an officially) Tj T*
(valid document \(OVD\): passport, driving licence, voter identity card, or proof of possession of) Tj T*
(an Aadhaar number. A customer's self-declaration of address is not acceptable as proof of) Tj T*
(address under any circumstances.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(3. Handling of Aadhaar numbers. Neither the Bank nor any vendor may store a customer's full) Tj T*
(Aadhaar number. The first eight digits must be redacted or masked before any copy of an Aadhaar) Tj T*
(document is stored.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(4. Record retention. KYC records, identification documents and records of transactions must be) Tj T*
(preserved for at least five years after the business relationship with the customer has ended) Tj T*
(or the account has been closed, whichever is later. Records must not be destroyed earlier.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(5. Periodic updation of KYC. KYC must be updated at least once every two years for high-risk) Tj T*
(customers, once every eight years for medium-risk customers and once every ten years for low-) Tj T*
(risk customers.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(6. Consent and data sharing. Customer data may be shared with a third party only with the) Tj T*
(customer's explicit, informed consent and only for the purpose stated at the time of consent.) Tj T*
(Customer data must never be used for marketing or shared with marketing partners without a) Tj T*
(separate opt-in consent.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(7. Vendor oversight and audit. Vendors must give the Bank and the Reserve Bank of India) Tj T*
(unrestricted access to premises, systems and records for audit and inspection. Vendors must not) Tj T*
(sub-contract any processing of customer data without the Bank's prior written approval.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(8. Security incidents. Vendors must report any security incident or data breach affecting) Tj T*
(customer data to the Bank within six hours of detection.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(9. Data localisation. All customer data, including backups, must be stored only on systems) Tj T*
(located in India.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
ET
